===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[split]]-[[finger]] [[fastball]]}}

# {{lb|en|baseball}} A moderate rotation speed backspin [[pitch]] thrown with a ball gripped between the index finger and middle finger; it has good velocity, may have a precessing spin, and sinks as it approaches the [[plate]].
#: ''His strikeout pitch was his '''split-finger fastball'''.''

